116
00:08:49,892 --> 00:08:54,275
Publish v1.1.0 again with corrected notes:

117
00:08:54,833 --> 00:09:02,323
A tag can have one release, and a published version number must never be reused for different content (users,

118
00:09:02,323 --> 00:09:05,278
caches and lock files already refer to it).

119
00:09:05,278 --> 00:09:10,638
Changing the text of a release is fine; changing its code means a new version.

120
